{"id":51796,"date":"2026-06-23T08:17:04","date_gmt":"2026-06-23T07:17:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51796"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:20:40","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:20:40","slug":"a-encosta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/a-encosta\/","title":{"rendered":"A Encosta 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">A Encosta 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o de A Encosta 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong> na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizada pela prestigiada <strong>A.D.R.C. Crossmates<\/strong>, esta prova singular de corrida com obst\u00e1culos (OCR) convida duplas e entusiastas a desafiarem os seus limites f\u00edsicos e mentais num cen\u00e1rio monumental.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada instaladas no imponente <strong>Castelo de Alcoba\u00e7a<\/strong> a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o percurso de <strong>10 km<\/strong> conduz os atletas por trilhos florestais, pela emblem\u00e1tica encosta dos Crossmates, pelas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es do Mosteiro de Alcoba\u00e7a e pelo Parque Verde. As duplas progridem unidas por um dispositivo no membro superior, superando dezenas de desafios em equipa, existindo ainda uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> acess\u00edvel a todos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A estrutura t\u00e9cnica garante postos de abastecimento no Castelo e a meio do trajeto, seguro desportivo completo e um ambiente festivo com almo\u00e7o-conv\u00edvio no final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/l